 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-id1469378\" class=\"interactive-embedded-reading\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\" id=\"6\">Link to Learning</div>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-id3096241\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20220509.174553/resources/ec2c78396cc25bf3e0931f6e3dbc2f3fbc75d977\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" id=\"7\">\n</span>\n<p id=\"fs-id1724210\">View this video that describes how epigenetic regulation controls gene expression.\n\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1169842033590\" data-alt=\"epigenetic_reg\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"alternatives\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/16-3-eukaryotic-epigenetic-gene-regulation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click to view content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/epigenetic_reg\" class=\"os-is-iframe\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>",
